    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Genesis 1:2 — “And the Spirit of God was hovering over the face of the waters.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "John 6:63 — “It is the Spirit who gives life; the flesh profits nothing.”",
    "GREEK": "πνεῦμα",
